sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Server
  participant DB as Database
  participant WS as WebSocketService
  participant U as UserClient

  S->>DB: create notification record
  S->>WS: emit notification event (userId)
  WS-->>U: push realtime notification
  U-->>WS: ack
  WS-->>S: ack
  S->>DB: mark delivered/record ack
